  "result": "Perfect! All 61 tests pass. Here's what I added:\n\n**New error codes in `src/errors.js`:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on the invoice\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: Can only modify invoices with status \"draft\"\n\n**New functions in `src/invoices.js`:**\n\n1. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Add or increase a line\n   - If SKU doesn't exist: adds new line with product details from catalogue\n   - If SKU exists: increases that line's qty\n   - Validates qty (same as createInvoice: must be positive integer)\n   - Validates SKU exists (returns UNKNOWN_SKU if not)\n   - Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n   - Never mutates the input invoice\n\n2. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Remove a line by SKU\n   - Removes the line with that SKU\n   - Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU not on invoice\n   - Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line (invoice must have \u22651 line)\n   - Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n   - Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**Added 16 new tests** covering:\n- Adding new lines and increasing existing lines\n- Input immutability preservation\n- Validation (qty, SKU, draft status)\n- Edge cases (last line, non-existent line, non-draft invoice)\n- Chaining operations (adding and removing in sequence)\n\nAll calculations and operations follow the house rules: no mutations, no throws, fail(CODE) for errors. \u2713",
